  Q['38.321#6.1.2'] = { spec: 'TS 38.321', text: 'A MAC PDU consists of one or more MAC subPDUs. Each MAC subPDU consists of one of the following: -A MAC subheader only (including padding); -A MAC subheader and a MAC SDU; -A MAC subheader and a MAC CE; -A MAC subheader and padding. The MAC SDUs are of variable sizes. Each MAC subheader corresponds to either a MAC SDU, a MAC CE, or padding. A MAC subheader except for fixed sized MAC CE, padding, and a MAC SDU containing UL CCCH consists of the header fields R/F/LCID/(eLCID)/L.…' };
